# Trust: Bastok (bastok 92): Naji's 984 against Prog 1. Accepted; Naji's 980 first (Naji learned, Prog 1): Naji's
# 981 would follow at Prog 1. Trust: Windurst then completed by GM: the other-nation test comes first, so 984 plays
# at Prog 1 (not 981): completed at once (Naji learned again, the card deleted, KEYITEM_LOST) and Prog cleared by the
# completion.
lists Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/980 Metalworks/onEventFinish/984
char zone=Metalworks pos=64,-14,-4 lvl=75 nation=1
quest Bastok.TrustBastok accepted
keyitem BlueInstituteCard
login
trigger Naji                   # Prog 0: 980
finish                         # Naji learned, Prog 1
trigger Naji                   # Prog 1, no other nation: 981
finish
quest Windurst.TrustWindurst completed
trigger Naji                   # Windurst's completed: 984, not 981
finish                         # completed, Naji learned (already known), the card deleted
